*>   2009-11-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 901
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PAYNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0003.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY PAY0003C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 WS-BEN             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 PR-RT              PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHECK-BENEFITS
    PERFORM SET-PENSION
    DISPLAY "WS-BEN=" WS-BEN
    DISPLAY "PR-RT=" PR-RT
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-BENEFITS.
    *> BENEFITS ELIGIBILITY
    IF WS-ETYP = 'F'
       OR (WS-ETYP = 'P' AND W-HR NOT LESS THAN 25)
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-BEN
    END-IF.
SET-PENSION.
    *> PENSION CONTRIBUTION RATE
    IF P-EN = 'Y' AND WS-SVCY >= 2
        MOVE 0.0600 TO PR-RT
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0200 TO PR-RT
    END-IF.
